OL,3,AUK and EU agree draft deal to scrap
OL,4,ABrexit red tape over food exports
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK and EU have agreed a draft deal
OL,7,Fon removing post-Brexit checks from
OL,8,Ffood and agriculture exports, ahead of
OL,9,Fthe UK-EU summit later this month.
OL,11,FThe BBC understands the 200-page draft
OL,12,Ftext for this so called "SPS" [sanitary
OL,13,Fand phytosanitary] agreement has been
OL,14,Fcirculated to EU nations in Brussels
OL,15,Ffor consideration at a meeting on
OL,16,FWednesday.
OL,18,FSimilar texts for deals on emissions
OL,19,Ftrading and a youth travel and work
OL,20,Fscheme have also been circulated
OL,21,Falongside a 15-page draft joint
OL,22,Fstatement for UK and EU top leaders.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
